            <ArticleTitle>Very late stent thrombosis after implantation of drug eluting stent.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>879-80</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A case of late stent occlusion of a Sirolimus eluting Cypher stent (Cordis, Johnson and Johnson) presenting as acute ST elevation myocardial infarction 22 months after deployment is reported. The possible mechanisms are discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
